## 📂 Portfolio Projects to Build

To land interviews at top companies, build **business-oriented, problem-solving projects** rather than generic tutorials.

| Project Title | Tech Stack | Business Impact / Goal |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **E-Commerce Customer Churn Analysis** | SQL, Python, Power BI | Identify key drivers of customer churn and build a interactive dashboard predicting high-risk users. |
| **A/B Testing Analysis for Product Features** | Python, Statistics, Tableau | Analyze user behavior changes across test variants to recommend product decisions. |
| **Financial & Sales Executive Dashboard** | SQL, Tableau / Power BI | Build an automated pipeline and C-level executive dashboard tracking revenue, CAC, and ROI. |
| **Logistics & Supply Chain Optimization** | SQL, Python (Pandas/Seaborn) | Optimize delivery routes and analyze warehouse delay patterns to reduce operational costs. |

